  `trace(x)` returns the sum along the main diagonal of each inner-most matrix
  in x. If x is of rank `k` with shape `[I, J, K, ..., L, M, N]`, then output
  is a tensor of rank `k-2` with dimensions `[I, J, K, ..., L]` where

